# RONDB-1120 Phase 2: block-level protocol and state-machine cases driven
# directly against DblqhProxy / DBLQH (node_failure_test_plan.md section 5).
# Section 5.3, TD-1 .. TD-8: proxy teardown idempotence, RELEASE identity
# validation and the SETUP owner-list validation.  Section 5.4, ID-1 ..
# ID-6: identity validation on forged peer signals (REDISTRIBUTE_REQ /
# CONF / REF, FINAL_REP), CTE scan continuation tokens and the coordinator
# check of consumer requests; ID-5 uses a second API node id when one is
# free.  Needs error inserts 5136 and 5146 and the leak-check DUMPs 2361 /
# 2362 / 2363, which crash a node on a leak; the program prints PASSED or
# FAILED.
--source include/have_ndb.inc
--source include/have_debug.inc
--source include/have_ndb_debug.inc

--echo Running testCteProtocol
--exec $NDB_PUSH_AGG_DIR/testCteProtocol -c "$NDB_CONNECTSTRING" -m $MASTER_MYPORT
